        "message": "=<h2>Еженедельная статистика GitHub Issues — ssmetanka/algos</h2>\n<p>Период: последние 7 дней (дата отчёта: <b>{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.week_date }}</b>)</p>\n<p>Открыто за неделю: <b>{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.open_count }}</b> | Закрыто: <b>{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.closed_count }}</b> | Комментариев: <b>{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.comments_count }}</b></p>\n\n<h3>1. Статистика по типам и сравнение с прошлой неделей (Δ)</h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"background:#f4f4f4;\">\n      <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left;\">Тип</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left;\">Текущая неделя</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left;\">Прошлая неделя</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left;\">Δ (изменение)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\"><b>Всего Issues</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.total }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.prev.total || 0 }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\"><b>{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.delta.total }}</b></td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">bug</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.bugs }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.prev.bugs || 0 }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.delta.bugs }}</td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">feature</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.features }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.prev.features || 0 }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.delta.features }}</td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">task</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.tasks }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.prev.tasks || 0 }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.delta.tasks }}</td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">needs-triage</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.needs_triage }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.prev.needs_triage || 0 }}</td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.delta.needs_triage }}</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>2. Статистика по авторам</h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;max-width:400px;\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"background:#f4f4f4;\">\n      <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left;\">Автор</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left;\">Issues</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    {{ $('Aggregate & Compute Delta').first().json.authorRowsHtml }}\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:16px;padding:12px;background:#f8f9fa;border-left:4px solid #4f46e5;\">\n  <h3 style=\"margin-top:0;\">AI-комментарий недели</h3>\n  <p>{{ $('Generate AI Commentary').first().json.tex